<title>FRANCE: Gaumont H1 profit rises.</title>
<headline>Gaumont H1 profit rises.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-09-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30, 1996.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of French francs unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net attributable			    33.7  vs	    30.4</p>
<p>    Pre-tax, pre-exceptional		  56.6  vs	    47.3</p>
<p>    Cashflow				     361.8  vs	   192.3</p>
<p>    Turnover				     627    vs	   555</p>
<p>NOTE - Film theatre company Gaumont gave its results in a statement.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom +33 1 4221 5452</p>
